    // This pushes the heuristic toward Best-Fit behavior.
    score += (post_residual as f64).powf(1.1);

    // 2. Harmonic Class Logic: Reward residuals that leave "perfect" space for common item sizes.
    // We prioritize keeping space that can accommodate future items (next_item_size).
