    // The base score is post_residual. We refine this based on harmonic packing principles.

    // 2. Penalty for creating "dead space" (small residuals that cannot fit common items)
    // If post_residual is in the range [1, 9], it is highly likely to be wasted.
    if post_residual > 0 && post_residual < 10 {
